@startuml
title HTQLHDK - Containers and logical modules
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Browser
component "Web UI\nReact + TypeScript" as UI
component "Backend API\nASP.NET Core .NET 10" as API {
  [Identity & Authorization] as AUTH
  [Asset F-01] as A
  [Scheduling F-02] as S
  [Import F-03] as I
  [Finding & Review] as F
  [Remediation & Risk F-04] as R
  [File / Export / Masking] as X
  [Audit Writer] as AU
}
component "Worker\nsame release, separate identity" as W
database "PostgreSQL 17\n27 business tables" as DB
storage "Private object storage\nstaging/raw/evidence/exports" as OBJ
component "IdP OIDC" as IDP
component "KMS / Secrets" as KMS
component "OpenTelemetry collector" as OTEL

Browser --> UI : HTTPS
UI --> API : REST / upload stream
API --> IDP : OIDC
API --> DB : api_runtime / audit_writer
API --> OBJ : stream download / create staging
API --> KMS : key + secret references
W --> DB : worker_runtime / audit_writer
W --> OBJ : parse/finalize/export/reconcile
W --> KMS : crypto operation
API --> OTEL : safe telemetry
W --> OTEL : safe telemetry

note right of W
Khong dung in-memory queue.
Claim durable state tu PostgreSQL,
idempotent va bounded retry.
end note
@enduml

